; ⚠️ GENERATED BY tools/gen_regions.py FROM tools/region_spec_sunspire.py. Edit the spec.
;
; ====================================================================================================
; THE SUNSPIRE DOMINION
; ====================================================================================================
;
; South beyond the Southmarch Gate. The caravan road comes through a gap in the northern escarpment
; into the dry basins, crosses them between two mesas and drops into the water-fed jungle belt, where
; Saffra Wells keeps the oasis and the caravans. West of the wells, at the foot of the library mesa,
; the Veiled Archive's great library stands half-buried in the sand of an older civilisation. South of
; the belt the country dries and reddens again up to the Crimson Mission, the Prophet's seat, whose
; walled sanctum is where the fifth Flamebearer is fought.
;
; Fourteen of the twenty cells carry ground, weather, ecology and at most a road. Do not fill them in.

